ADD <expr>,<expr>,<expr> 4701 2 4 i8096-short-long-3 field-mask=FEFE
ADD <expr>,#<expr> 65 1 3 i8096-combine field-mask=FEFFFF
ADD <expr>,<expr> 6701 2 3 i8096-short-long-2 field-mask=FEFE
